        a: "You need to spend ₹20,000 or more in the current calendar month on eligible transactions. Eligible categories include dining, shopping, fuel, travel, and subscriptions — but not utility bills or insurance post-February 2026. Lounge access unlocks for the following month. If you meet the milestone in June, you get unlimited lounge access in July. If you miss the milestone, you lose lounge access for that month — there is no grace period or partial visit allowance."
